OL,3,ARosalia scoops historic third best
OL,4,Aalbum award at Latin Grammys
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpanish star Rosalia has made history
OL,7,Fas the first woman to win the best
OL,8,Falbum award at the Latin Grammys three
OL,9,Ftimes, after being recognised for her
OL,10,Fproject Lux.
OL,12,FThe singer took home five trophies in
OL,13,Ftotal, including two for her track La
OL,14,FPerla which was named song of the year
OL,15,Fand best pop song.
OL,17,FLa Perla was also nominated for record
OL,18,Fof the year but missed out to Argentine
OL,19,Fsinger Milo J's song Nino.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
